      "message": "test(contour): move the Contour Do not touch pins into the do_not_touch suite\n\nThe pins join the existing directory suite (#3187). The fixture tool takes\na longer flute: main's flute law (#3525) blocks the old one under 24 mm of\nstock with or without protection. The NC check measures the true gap of\neach tool band. The sketch and tilted cases pin only what protection adds,\nbecause their plain paths already have findings on main. The unsupported\nkind example is now a Slot.\n\nRefs #3344\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
