      "message": "fix(contour): Do not touch for 2D Contour operations\n\nThe Boundary group of a Contour shows Pick protected. The Contour\ngenerators keep the flutes, the shank and the holder clear of each\nprotected face and edge, on cuts, leads, links and plunges. A Contour\nthat cannot keep clear is refused, and the refusal names the item. A\nContour with no protected item gives the same toolpath as before.\n\nFixes #3344\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
